# This project uses Postgres (required for Vercel deployment — Vercel's
# filesystem is read-only/ephemeral, so SQLite's file can't persist there).
# Get a free Postgres database from Vercel Postgres, Supabase, or Neon,
# then paste its connection string here:
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/expense_platform"

# For local development without setting up Postgres, you can switch back:
# 1. In prisma/schema.prisma, change provider back to "sqlite"
# 2. DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
